# Scripts that a job holding a write token runs, and the files those scripts import or call. A change to any of
# them also needs a clean Codex security review (PROC-0001, "Review policy, 2026-11-01"). review-gate reads this
# file from the base branch. One path per line; a path ending in / covers a folder.
#
# Keep it current: a PR that gives a job a write token, or adds a script to such a job, adds the script here.
# This file is under .github/, so changing it is itself risky.
#
# Not covered: these jobs also build and test the product itself (dotnet, pnpm, cargo), so product code,
# manifests and dependencies run with the token too. Scoping the write token to the publish step is what closes that.

# release-platform.yml publish job (contents, id-token, attestations: write)
# validate.yml publish-libraries job (packages, id-token, attestations: write)
